      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s historic district is linear, featuring the Snowville Christian Church and a distinctive Masonic Temple that date back to the 19th century.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        20,
        21
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
        "Web source 1"
